uting, cloud connectivity, AI models, and intelligent dashboards into scalable platforms for enterprise, industrial, commercial, and government applications. Our solutions help organisations improve visibility, automate routine processes, optimise resource utilisation, and respond more effectively to changing operational conditions."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"BENEFITS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Key Benefits"},{"t":"ul","items":["Real-time operational intelligence","AI-driven predictive analytics","Automated workflows","Reduced operational costs","Improved asset visibility","Faster decision-making","Scalable edge-to-cloud architecture","Enhanced operational efficiency"],"ordered":false},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"IoT &amp; AI Portfolio"},{"t":"p","html":"Our IoT &amp; AI portfolio combines smart sensors, edge AI devices, industrial gateways, embedded AI hardware, cloud platforms, machine learning solutions, intelligent dashboards, and automation technologies that enable connected, data-driven operations across multiple industries."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 500\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M295.286 242.519v-13.591a6.347 6.347 0 0 1 6.344-6.344 6.34 6.34 0 0 1 6.344 6.344v13.591a6.336 6.336 0 0 1-6.344 6.338 6.34 6.34 0 0 1-6.344-6.338m-31.425 0v-13.591c0-3.501 2.843-6.344 6.344-6.344s6.344 2.843 6.344 6.344v13.591a6.34 6.34 0 0 1-6.344 6.338 6.34 6.34 0 0 1-6.344-6.338m31.425-45.016v-13.591a6.347 6.347 0 0 1 6.344-6.344 6.34 6.34 0 0 1 6.344 6.344v13.591a6.337 6.337 0 0 1-6.344 6.339 6.345 6.345 0 0 1-6.344-6.339m-31.425 0v-13.591c0-3.501 2.843-6.344 6.344-6.344s6.344 2.843 6.344 6.344v13.591a6.344 6.344 0 0 1-12.688 0m31.425-45.016v-13.591a6.